    <description>Open Opportunities or Production wins (2024 only) with Meteor Lake as Intel Platform &amp; Client Computing as product segment  - includes MTL exceptions by opp ID</description>
    <filter>
        <booleanFilter>(2 AND 3 AND 6 AND (1 OR (4 AND 5)) AND 7) OR 8</booleanFilter>
